{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07479","headline":"喜朱拾遗承恩拜命赴任上都 · 刘长卿","name":"喜朱拾遗承恩拜命赴任上都","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"诏书徵拜脱荷裳，身去东山闭草堂。\n阊阖九天通奏籍，华亭一鹤在朝行。\n沧洲离别风烟远，青琐幽深漏刻长。\n今日却回垂钓处，海鸥相见已高翔。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07479.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07479","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}